{"id": "DfcXIn6xR8O", "title": "Video by anim_aman", "description": "Woh flight ghar ja rahi thi… main bas khidki tak ja paaya. 🪔\n\nNeeche poora sheher diyon se jagmaga raha tha, aur meri khidki pe bas ek diya.\nPhone pe “Maa” chamka. Uthaya nahi… pata tha awaaz bhar aayegi.\nFlight dhund mein kho gayi. Laptop ab bhi khula hai.\n\nAgle saal pakka, Maa. 🤍\n\nUn sab ke liye jo is Diwali ghar se door hain… office mein, PG mein, kisi aur sheher ki khidki pe.\n\nComment karo: tum kahan ho, ghar kahan hai? 👇\nAur us dost ko bhejo jo is baar bhi ghar nahi ja paaya 🪔\n\n#diwali #missinghome #gharkiyaad", "channel": "anim_aman", "uploader_id": "52657595533", "uploader": "Aman", "timestamp": 1794060561, "like_count": 20725, "comment_count": 48, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1664251351723775a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 67.299, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOVWlbuEbcH72ZHbKDvI-4s4KGZDfQelR9iKwZPYC_ULVeQS3olUyazjIc5l8BshEWYJ_kescyo7juMOAwwfwPi7LQebCJ0ZXVr0as.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdpbvWsxdIsGUQaCtDNSIsQhBiqdAnrHohtcM7cecGfBZVjBJodBkEES6W3z8IdYV4nIDVlwWRVzW9iUSS23oQUu&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=JznUmkz0-voQ7kNvwFXjBbi&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=SGzowXIwiaM2D2-V7by5zw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSdE7pp5R-7NHqmpXMJXnnxPGwMHe651iAnQOYdOso45Q&oe=6AF41C63", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 67.299, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla